      "id": "claim_8c3185d31dfb4388871c69a314283dbd",
      "statement": "`agent.tools` is a lazy public export facade: `_TOOL_MODULES` maps curated names to local and selected integration modules, lookup imports and caches an export, and `_LazyToolsModule` prevents an identically named imported submodule from shadowing that export.",
